A strong submission
● Feels like a small but complete product slice, not a collection of disconnected screens.
● Makes the operator more confident when the AI is uncertain, rather than hiding uncertainty.
● Uses motion, audio, and visual detail only when they clarify state or improve trust.
● Explains trade-offs honestly. A polished end-to-end experience beats an overbuilt feature set.